{
 "sentences": [
  {
   "id": "h1",
   "group": "g1",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.608,
   "text": "Samay Raina ke tickets ek ghante se kam mein ek lakh se zyada bik gaye, District app pe, BookMyShow pe nahi.",
   "cap": "Samay Raina ke tickets ek ghante se kam mein ek lakh se zyada bik gaye, District app pe, BookMyShow pe nahi."
  },
  {
   "id": "h2",
   "group": "g1",
   "start": 4.488,
   "end": 9.728,
   "text": "Aur Samay ne screenshot dala: aapke aage 12,569 log. Intezaar, lagbhag das minute.",
   "cap": "Aur Samay ne screenshot dala: aapke aage 12,569 log. Intezaar, lagbhag das minute."
  },
  {
   "id": "h3",
   "group": "g2",
   "start": 10.297,
   "end": 15.703,
   "text": "Yeh crash nahi tha. Yeh system design tha. Toh ek lakh log ek saath aaye, app tooti kyun nahi? Aur ek seat do logon ko kaise nahi mili?",
   "cap": "Yeh crash nahi tha. Yeh system design tha. Toh ek lakh log ek saath aaye, app tooti kyun nahi? Aur ek seat do logon ko kaise nahi mili?"
  },
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "group": "g3",
   "start": 16.92,
   "end": 20.903,
   "text": "Pehle ek chhota math. Ek lakh tickets, ek ghanta. Yaani lagbhag 28 tickets har second.",
   "cap": "Pehle ek chhota math. Ek lakh tickets, ek ghanta. Yaani lagbhag 28 tickets har second."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "group": "g3",
   "start": 20.543,
   "end": 24.643,
   "text": "28 per second? Itna toh ek chhota server bhi sambhal le. To dikkat kahan thi?",
   "cap": "28 per second? Itna toh ek chhota server bhi sambhal le. To dikkat kahan thi?"
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "group": "g4",
   "start": 25.345,
   "end": 31.864,
   "text": "Dikkat bechne mein nahi thi, dikkat thi sabka ek saath, ek hi pal, ek hi seat ke liye aana. Isko solve karne ke paanch tareeke hain. Teesra sabse hoshiyaar hai.",
   "cap": "Dikkat bechne mein nahi thi, dikkat thi sabka ek saath, ek hi pal, ek hi seat ke liye aana. Isko solve karne ke paanch tareeke hain. Teesra sabse hoshiyaar hai."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1a",
   "group": "g5",
   "start": 33.048,
   "end": 38.112,
   "text": "Pehla tareeka: bheed ko ek saath aane hi mat do. Registration pehle: 27 September raat gyarah baje tak.",
   "cap": "Pehla tareeka: bheed ko ek saath aane hi mat do. Registration pehle: 27 September raat gyarah baje tak."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1b",
   "group": "g5",
   "start": 37.872,
   "end": 42.752,
   "text": "Phir pre-sale, poore 48 ghante, aur woh bhi sirf registered logon ke liye. Booking ka link? WhatsApp pe.",
   "cap": "Phir pre-sale, poore 48 ghante, aur woh bhi sirf registered logon ke liye. Booking ka link? WhatsApp pe."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1c",
   "group": "g6",
   "start": 43.528,
   "end": 47.597,
   "text": "Taylor Swift ke tickets pe Ticketmaster ne khud maana tha: sale ko lambe time mein baantna chahiye tha.",
   "cap": "Taylor Swift ke tickets pe Ticketmaster ne khud maana tha: sale ko lambe time mein baantna chahiye tha."
  },
  {
   "id": "q1",
   "group": "g7",
   "start": 48.575,
   "end": 52.458,
   "text": "Par pre-sale khulte hi, jo aaye, woh ek saath aaye. To doosra tareeka: virtual waiting room.",
   "cap": "Par pre-sale khulte hi, jo aaye, woh ek saath aaye. To doosra tareeka: virtual waiting room."
  },
  {
   "id": "q2",
   "group": "g7",
   "start": 52.298,
   "end": 57.258,
   "text": "Aap booking page pe nahi, ek line mein ho. Aapko number mila: aapke aage 12,569 log.",
   "cap": "Aap booking page pe nahi, ek line mein ho. Aapko number mila: aapke aage 12,569 log."
  },
  {
   "id": "q3",
   "group": "g8",
   "start": 57.951,
   "end": 64.388,
   "text": "Line pehle aao pehle paao ki hoti hai. Cloudflare ke docs kehte hain: aapke browser mein ek cookie, jisme likha hota hai aap line mein kab aaye.",
   "cap": "Line pehle aao pehle paao ki hoti hai. Cloudflare ke docs kehte hain: aapke browser mein ek cookie, jisme likha hota hai aap line mein kab aaye."
  },
  {
   "id": "q4",
   "group": "g9",
   "start": 65.125,
   "end": 72.266,
   "text": "Aur woh das minute? Screenshot ka math: 12,569 ko 600 second se baanto, to har second lagbhag 21 log andar jaate hain.",
   "cap": "Aur woh das minute? Screenshot ka math: 12,569 ko 600 second se baanto, to har second lagbhag 21 log andar jaate hain."
  },
  {
   "id": "q5",
   "group": "g9",
   "start": 71.926,
   "end": 75.906,
   "text": "Yaani queue aapko rokne ke liye nahi, server ko bachane ke liye hai. Yeh bug nahi, system ka kaam hai.",
   "cap": "Yaani queue aapko rokne ke liye nahi, server ko bachane ke liye hai. Yeh bug nahi, system ka kaam hai."
  },
  {
   "id": "t1",
   "group": "g10",
   "start": 77.126,
   "end": 80.935,
   "text": "Ab aap andar aaye. Seat chuni. Magar usi pal ek aur insaan ne bhi wahi seat chuni. Ab?",
   "cap": "Ab aap andar aaye. Seat chuni. Magar usi pal ek aur insaan ne bhi wahi seat chuni. Ab?"
  },
  {
   "id": "t2",
   "group": "g10",
   "start": 80.595,
   "end": 86.615,
   "text": "Dono ko confirmed bol diya, to jhagda. Isliye seat pe hold lagta hai. Redis mein ek hi command: SET seat NX EX.",
   "cap": "Dono ko confirmed bol diya, to jhagda. Isliye seat pe hold lagta hai. Redis mein ek hi command: SET seat NX EX."
  },
  {
   "id": "t3",
   "group": "g11",
   "start": 87.511,
   "end": 92.933,
   "text": "NX ka matlab: sirf tab set karo jab pehle se na ho. Pehle ko OK mila, doosre ko nil: seat abhi kisi aur ke paas hai.",
   "cap": "NX ka matlab: sirf tab set karo jab pehle se na ho. Pehle ko OK mila, doosre ko nil: seat abhi kisi aur ke paas hai."
  },
  {
   "id": "t4",
   "group": "g12",
   "start": 93.728,
   "end": 100.114,
   "text": "Hold ke saath timer bhi. Agar aap payment nahi kar paaye, seat apne aap chhoot jaati hai. Isliye seat map mein seats gayab hoti hain, aur wapas bhi aa jaati hain.",
   "cap": "Hold ke saath timer bhi. Agar aap payment nahi kar paaye, seat apne aap chhoot jaati hai. Isliye seat map mein seats gayab hoti hain, aur wapas bhi aa jaati hain."
  },
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "group": "g13",
   "start": 101.246,
   "end": 105.471,
   "text": "Ab paisa. Aapne pay dabaya, network atka, aapne phir dabaya. Kya do baar paisa katega?",
   "cap": "Ab paisa. Aapne pay dabaya, network atka, aapne phir dabaya. Kya do baar paisa katega?"
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "group": "g13",
   "start": 105.291,
   "end": 110.571,
   "text": "Nahi, kyunki har payment ke saath ek idempotency key jaati hai. Same key, same jawab, ek hi charge. Stripe ke docs yahi kehte hain.",
   "cap": "Nahi, kyunki har payment ke saath ek idempotency key jaati hai. Same key, same jawab, ek hi charge. Stripe ke docs yahi kehte hain."
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "group": "g14",
   "start": 111.35,
   "end": 117.465,
   "text": "District ne 50 percent abhi, baaki baad mein wala option bhi diya. Matlab system ko ek aur halat yaad rakhni padti hai: aadha paid.",
   "cap": "District ne 50 percent abhi, baaki baad mein wala option bhi diya. Matlab system ko ek aur halat yaad rakhni padti hai: aadha paid."
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "group": "g14",
   "start": 117.345,
   "end": 120.485,
   "text": "Aur seat tabhi pakki, jab payment confirm ho. Warna hold chhoot jaata hai.",
   "cap": "Aur seat tabhi pakki, jab payment confirm ho. Warna hold chhoot jaata hai."
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "group": "g15",
   "start": 121.465,
   "end": 127.586,
   "text": "Ab bots. Ticketmaster ne kaha unhe pehle se teen guna bot traffic mila. Isliye link sirf registered logon ko, aur rate limits.",
   "cap": "Ab bots. Ticketmaster ne kaha unhe pehle se teen guna bot traffic mila. Isliye link sirf registered logon ko, aur rate limits."
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "group": "g16",
   "start": 128.499,
   "end": 137.521,
   "text": "Ek zaroori baat: District ne apna design public nahi kiya. Jo main dikha raha hoon, woh screenshot ne dikhaya aur woh jo industry mein aam hai. Do lakh tickets, chaalis crore wali baatein, abhi tak unverified hain.",
   "cap": "Ek zaroori baat: District ne apna design public nahi kiya. Jo main dikha raha hoon, woh screenshot ne dikhaya aur woh jo industry mein aam hai. Do lakh tickets, chaalis crore wali baatein, abhi tak unverified hain."
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "group": "g17",
   "start": 138.5,
   "end": 143.105,
   "text": "To agli baar line mein dikhe aapke aage baarah hazaar, gussa mat karna. Wahi line aapki seat bacha rahi hai.",
   "cap": "To agli baar line mein dikhe aapke aage baarah hazaar, gussa mat karna. Wahi line aapki seat bacha rahi hai."
  },
  {
